{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a premium, minimal newsletter signup section for a modern streetwear / fashion brand.
    
    Match the provided reference image very closely in layout, spacing, typography, colors, alignment, and overall visual hierarchy.
    
    SECTION DESIGN:
    - Full-width section with a very dark near-black background (#0D0B0C).
    - Add a subtle warm dark brown/red radial glow behind the center-left area, fading smoothly into the black background.
    - Section should feel premium, cinematic, modern, and slightly edgy.
    - Keep the overall design clean with lots of empty space.
    - Desktop section height should be approximately 315–330px.
    
    CONTENT:
    At the top center, add a small uppercase eyebrow text:
    "STAY CONNECTED"
    
    Style:
    - Small font size around 9–11px
    - Letter spacing around 4px
    - Uppercase
    - Warm orange/red color (#D96845)
    
    Below it, add the main heading:
    "STAY OFF DUTY WITH US"
    
    Style:
    - Large condensed-looking uppercase typography
    - Approximately 34–38px on desktop
    - Font weight around 400
    - White/off-white color (#F5F2F0)
    - Center aligned
    - Tight line height
    
    Below the heading, add supporting text:
    "Get new drops, exclusive offers, crew stories and rewards updates delivered to your inbox."
    
    Style:
    - 13–14px
    - Light gray (#A8A3A3)
    - Maximum width around 500px
    - Center aligned
    - Line height around 1.5
    - On desktop it should wrap into two lines similar to the reference.
    
    FORM:
    Create a horizontal newsletter form centered below the description.
    
    The form should contain:
    1. First name input
       Placeholder: "First name (optional)"
    2. Email input
       Placeholder: "Your email address"
    3. Button
       Text: "Join the Crew"
    
    Input styling:
    - Dark transparent/near-black background
    - 1px subtle dark brown/gray border
    - Rounded corners around 8px
    - Height around 38px
    - Text color white
    - Placeholder color #777477
    - First name input width around 143px
    - Email input width around 187px
    - Gap between fields around 9px
    
    Button styling:
    - Width around 118px
    - Height around 38px
    - Rounded corners around 8px
    - Bright coral-to-red gradient background
    - Approximate colors: #FF3D5A to #FF6848
    - White text
    - Font size around 12px
    - Medium font weight
    - Text: "Join the Crew"
    
    Place all three form elements on one horizontal row on desktop.
    
    PRIVACY TEXT:
    Under the form, centered:
    "We respect your privacy. No spam, ever. Unsubscribe anytime."
    
    Style:
    - 9–10px
    - Gray color (#777474)
    - Add approximately 12px spacing below the form.
    
    RESPONSIVE DESIGN:
    - On mobile, stack the inputs and button vertically.
    - Inputs and button should become full width with a maximum width around 360px.
    - Maintain comfortable spacing and preserve the centered layout.
    - Reduce heading size to approximately 28–30px on mobile.
    - Keep the dark gradient/glow background.
    - Ensure the section does not become excessively tall on mobile.
    
    SHOPIFY FUNCTIONALITY:
    - Use Shopify's native newsletter/customer form functionality so email submissions work with Shopify's customer/newsletter system.
    - Make all text editable through the Shopify Theme Editor.
    - Make eyebrow text, heading, description, placeholders, button text, and privacy text editable.
    - Make background color, glow color, text colors, button colors, border radius, and section spacing configurable where practical.
    - Use semantic HTML and accessible labels.
    - Include proper focus states for inputs and button.
    - Do not add unnecessary icons, images, cards, borders, or decorative elements.
    - Do not change the overall layout from the reference image.
    
    IMPORTANT:
    The final result should visually resemble the supplied reference: a compact premium newsletter CTA with centered typography, horizontal form, dark black/brown atmospheric gradient, and coral-red CTA button.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-newsletter-signup-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top }}px 20px {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom }}px;
    overflow: hidden;
    min-height: {{ block.settings.section_min_height }}px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-newsletter-signup-{{ ai_gen_id }}::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 35%;
    width: 600px;
    height: 600px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, {{ block.settings.glow_color }} 0%, transparent 70%);
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    opacity: {{ block.settings.glow_opacity | divided_by: 100.0 }};
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .ai-newsletter-signup__container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    max-width: 700px;
    width: 100%;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ai-newsletter-signup__eyebrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.eyebrow_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.eyebrow_color }};
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.eyebrow_letter_spacing }}px;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .ai-newsletter-signup__heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.heading_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.heading_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.heading_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    text-transform: uppercase;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  .ai-newsletter-signup__description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.description_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.description_color }};
    line-height: 1.5;
    max-width: 520px;
    margin: 0 auto 28px;
  }

  .ai-newsletter-signup__form-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    gap: {{ block.settings.form_gap }}px;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.privacy_spacing }}px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .ai-newsletter-signup__input-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.input_background }};
    border: {{ block.settings.input_border_width }}px solid {{ block.settings.input_border_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.input_border_radius }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.input_height }}px;
    padding: 0 16px;
    color: {{ block.settings.input_text_color }};
    font-size: 13px;
    outline: none;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .ai-newsletter-signup__input-{{ ai_gen_id }}::placeholder {
    color: {{ block.settings.placeholder_color }};
  }

  .ai-newsletter-signup__input-{{ ai_gen_id }}:focus {
    border-color: {{ block.settings.input_focus_border_color }};
  }

  .ai-newsletter-signup__input--firstname-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.firstname_width }}px;
  }

  .ai-newsletter-signup__input--email-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.email_width }}px;
  }

  .ai-newsletter-signup__button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.button_width }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.input_height }}px;
    border: none;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.button_border_radius }}px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, {{ block.settings.button_gradient_start }} 0%, {{ block.settings.button_gradient_end }} 100%);
    color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.button_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: 500;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease, transform 0.1s ease;
  }

  .ai-newsletter-signup__button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .ai-newsletter-signup__button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:active {
    transform: scale(0.98);
  }

  .ai-newsletter-signup__privacy-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.privacy_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.privacy_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-newsletter-signup__message-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 13px;
    margin-top: 12px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ai-newsletter-signup__success-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.success_color }};
  }

  .ai-newsletter-signup__error-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.error_color }};
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-newsletter-signup-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top_mobile }}px 20px {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom_mobile }}px;
      min-height: auto;
    }

    .ai-newsletter-signup__heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-newsletter-signup__form-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex-direction: column;
      max-width: 360px;
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
    }

    .ai-newsletter-signup__input--firstname-{{ ai_gen_id }},
    .ai-newsletter-signup__input--email-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 100%;
    }

    .ai-newsletter-signup__button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<newsletter-signup-{{ ai_gen_id }}
  class="ai-newsletter-signup-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
  {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
>
  <div class="ai-newsletter-signup__container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% if block.settings.eyebrow_text != blank %}
      <div class="ai-newsletter-signup__eyebrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {{ block.settings.eyebrow_text }}
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    {% if block.settings.heading != blank %}
      <h2 class="ai-newsletter-signup__heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {{ block.settings.heading }}
      </h2>
    {% endif %}

    {% if block.settings.description != blank %}
      <p class="ai-newsletter-signup__description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {{ block.settings.description }}
      </p>
    {% endif %}

    {% form 'customer', class: 'ai-newsletter-signup__form-{{ ai_gen_id }}' %}
      <input type="hidden" name="contact[tags]" value="newsletter">
      
      <div class="ai-newsletter-signup__form-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <input
          type="text"
          name="contact[first_name]"
          class="ai-newsletter-signup__input-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-newsletter-signup__input--firstname-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
          placeholder="{{ block.settings.firstname_placeholder }}"
          autocomplete="given-name"
        >
        
        <input
          type="email"
          name="contact[email]"
          class="ai-newsletter-signup__input-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-newsletter-signup__input--email-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
          placeholder="{{ block.settings.email_placeholder }}"
          required
          autocomplete="email"
          aria-required="true"
          {% if form.errors %}
            aria-invalid="true"
            aria-describedby="ai-newsletter-signup-error-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
          {% endif %}
          {% if form.posted_successfully? %}
            aria-describedby="ai-newsletter-signup-success-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
          {% endif %}
        >
        
        <button
          type="submit"
          class="ai-newsletter-signup__button-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
        >
          {{ block.settings.button_text }}
        </button>
      </div>

      {% if block.settings.privacy_text != blank %}
        <p class="ai-newsletter-signup__privacy-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ block.settings.privacy_text }}
        </p>
      {% endif %}

      {% if form.posted_successfully? %}
        <div
          id="ai-newsletter-signup-success-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
          class="ai-newsletter-signup__message-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-newsletter-signup__success-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
        >
          {{ block.settings.success_message }}
        </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if form.errors %}
        <div
          id="ai-newsletter-signup-error-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
          class="ai-newsletter-signup__message-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-newsletter-signup__error-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
        >
          {{ form.errors.messages.email }}
        </div>
      {% endif %}
    {% endform %}
  </div>
</newsletter-signup-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class NewsletterSignup{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        const form = this.querySelector('.ai-newsletter-signup__form-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
        if (!form) return;

        form.addEventListener('submit', function(e) {
          const emailInput = form.querySelector('input[type="email"]');
          if (!emailInput.value) {
            e.preventDefault();
          }
        });
      }
    }

    customElements.define('newsletter-signup-{{ ai_gen_id }}', NewsletterSignup{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

